# Crafter gamebots answering a real player by tell (Crafting 2.0 WP8, CrafterCommerce and CrafterTalk). New writing (see
# docs/bot-voices). The truth rule: every fact in these lines is a slot the server fills from the crafter's real state:
# {title} and {skill} its crafting title and skill, {recipe} its craft, {item} the piece (or the pieces it really makes),
# {level} a real product level, {price} the price it really asks, {when} when the piece will really be ready, {terms} how it
# is paid ("coin up front", "pay when i hand it over", "materials only for guild"), {stock} what it really holds, {quality}
# that piece's real quality, {zone} where it really is. A caveat (a quality it cannot promise, a set it cannot finish) is
# always said in the server's fixed words, never by these lines. No line here invents a price, a piece or a time.

@kind craft_reply
@who Crafter
@levels 1-50

@topic craft_summary
{title}, {skill} {recipe}. i can do {item}, up to lvl {level}. {stock}
im {skill} {recipe}. i make {item}, lvl {level} tops. {stock}
{recipe} {skill}, so {item} up to lvl {level}. {stock}

@topic craft_summary_stock
{title} here, {skill} {recipe}. i make {item} up to lvl {level}. {stock}
{skill} {recipe}, i can do {item} up to lvl {level}. {stock}, pst if you want any

@topic craft_quote
[can do|i can make] the {item} (lvl {level}) for {price}, ready in {when}, {terms}. [deal?|want it?]
{item} lvl {level}, {price}. ready in {when}, {terms}. deal?
sure, {item} for {price}. ill have it in {when}, {terms}. ok?

@topic craft_quote_set
{item} lvl {level}, {count} pieces for {price} all in. ready in {when}, {terms}. deal?
can do the {item} (lvl {level}), {price} for the lot, ready in {when}, {terms}. want it?

@topic craft_stock
[got|have] a {stock} at {quality}%, {price}. {terms}
{stock}, {quality}% quality, {price}. {terms}
{stock} at {quality}%, {price}. {terms}
have a {quality}% {stock}, {price}. {terms}

@topic craft_stock_meet
sure, {terms} and ill trade it to you

@topic craft_cant
cant make that, my {recipe} is {skill}
[nah|sorry], cant do that one. {recipe} is only {skill}
cant do it, {recipe} is {skill} for now
not with {skill} {recipe}, sorry

@topic craft_cant_level
my {recipe} is only {skill}, lvl {level} is the best i do right now
not that high yet, {skill} {recipe}. lvl {level} is my limit
lvl {level} is as high as i go, {skill} {recipe}
{skill} {recipe}, so lvl {level} max for now

@topic craft_not_mine
not my trade, i do {recipe}
[i only do|im] {recipe}, try someone else for that
{recipe} only, sorry
wrong crafter, i do {recipe}

@topic craft_ask_what
sure, what do you need made?
yep, what are you after?
whatcha need?
what do you need?
sure, what piece?

@topic craft_deal
deal. ill make the {item} at my next break, ready in {when}. pay when i hand it over
[ok|cool], deal. {item} in {when}, pay me when i hand it over
deal, {item} in about {when}. pay on handover
done. {item} at my next break, {when} or so. pay when you get it

@topic craft_deposit
deal, {price} up front. drop the coin on me when youre near and ill start at my next break
ok, {price} first. hand it over when you find me and its on my list
{price} first, then i start
deal, {price} up front and its on my list

@topic craft_paid
got it, the {item} will be ready in {when}
[ty|thanks], {item} in {when}
coin got, {item} in {when}
ty, {item} will be done in {when}

@topic craft_haggle_accept
ok, {price} for the {item}. deal?
[fine|alright], {price}. deal?
ok ok, {price}. deal?
{price} works. deal?

@topic craft_haggle_counter
{price}, lowest i go
[meet me at|how about] {price}?
best i can do is {price}
{price}, thats fair

@topic craft_haggle_refuse
cant go that low, {price}
[nah|no], materials alone cost more than that. {price}
no can do, {price}
too low, {price} is the price

@topic craft_haggle_walk
done haggling, its {price} or nothing
{price}, take it or leave it
{price}, final offer
{price} or no deal

@topic craft_declined
np, let me know
ok, ill be around
np, maybe next time
ok, pst if you change your mind

@topic craft_status
not yet, ill make the {item} at my next break, about {when}
still on my list, the {item} should be done in {when}
not done yet, {item} in about {when}
{item} is next, about {when}

@topic craft_ready
your {item} is done, ill be in town at my break in {when}
{item} is ready, catch me at my break in {when}
{item} done, find me at my break in {when}
{item} is finished, in town at my break in {when}

@topic craft_break_ready
on my break now, in {zone}. come find me for the {item} and say yes
break time, im in {zone}. still got your {item}, come say yes
in {zone} on a break now. if you still want the {item} find me and say yes
ok im on break in {zone}. come grab the {item}, just say yes when youre near
{zone} for a bit, on my break. kept the {item} for you, say yes when you find me

@topic craft_stock_cancelled
ok, forget the {item} then
np, the {item} goes back in my bag
k, ill keep the {item} then

@topic craft_ready_tell
your {item} is done, im in {zone} for a bit, come by and say ready
{item} is ready! in {zone} on a break, come get it and say ready
{item} is done, im in {zone}, come say ready
{item} finished, find me in {zone} and say ready

@topic craft_delivered
here you go, your {item}. enjoy
there, {item} is yours. wear it well
all yours, the {item}
{item} handed over, enjoy

@topic craft_handover_trade
heres your {item}, {price} in the trade window
{item} is in the trade window, {price}
{item} in the window, {price}
trade window up, {item} for {price}

@topic craft_cancelled
ok, cancelled the {item}
np, the {item} is off my list
ok, no {item} then
cancelled, np

@topic craft_refuse
not dealing with you, sorry
no thanks, find another crafter
not for you, sorry
pass, ask someone else
